                  "blocks": {},
                  "name": "Accordion row",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<p>You deserve to know exactly what’s going into your body — and exactly why.</p><p><strong>Saw Palmetto Extract</strong><br/>Helps reduce DHT by supporting healthy hormone balance</p><p><strong>Hydrolyzed Marine Collagen<br/></strong>Supports skin elasticity, follicles, and hair structure.</p><p><strong>Methylsulfonylmethane (MSM)</strong><br/>Supports natural keratin production for stronger hair.</p><p><strong>Coenzyme Q10 (CoQ10)</strong><br/>Supports cellular energy and healthier scalp function.</p><p><strong>Zinc Bisglycinate Chelate</strong><br/>Supports growth, oil balance, and immune resilience.</p><p><strong>Hyaluronic Acid</strong><br/>Helps hydrate the scalp and support elasticity.</p><p><strong>Grape Seed Extract</strong><br/>Helps protect follicles through antioxidant support.</p><p><strong>Ashwagandha Root Extract</strong><br/>Helps reduce stress-related hair loss by supporting cortisol balance.</p>",
                    "content_list_style": "default",
                    "heading": "Ingredients"
                  },
                  "type": "custom-product-accordion-row"
                },
                "custom_product_accordion_row_aY6cUn": {
                  "blocks": {},
                  "name": "Accordion row",
                  "settings": {
                    "content": "<ul><li>Supports visibly fuller-looking hair   </li><li>Helps reduce excess shedding  </li><li>Supports healthy hair growth cycles  </li><li>Helps support healthy DHT activity  </li><li>Supports scalp circulation and nutrient delivery  </li><li>Reinforces weak, fragile strands  </li><li>Supports stress-related shedding recovery  </li><li>Drug-free formula with no minoxidil  </li><li>Designed for long-term follicle support</li></ul>",
                    "content_list_style": "default",
                    "heading": "Key Benefits"
                  },
                  "type": "custom-product-accordion-row"
                }
